// Fixture for the INV-SF-2 check exit gate (#5403).
// Dimensionless on purpose: a DIMENSIONAL cyclic let currently trips the
// #6584 forward-reference bug and fails at COMPILE time (exit 1 for the
// wrong reason). This file compiles cleanly and the cycle is detected in
// the EVAL phase, so `reify check` reaches finish_check and — before the
// gate — printed `error: circular let-binding dependency ...` alongside
// "All constraints satisfied." and exited 0 (observation esc-6584-2).
structure P {
    let a = b + 1
    let b = a + 1
}
